-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §141 גננת בבית ספר לחינוך מיוחד, וגננת
-- משתלבת: besides §§133–140, a kindergarten teacher in a special-education
-- school and an integrating kindergarten teacher get the special-education
-- allowance by the existing rules.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `141 גננת בבית ספר לחינוך מיוחד, וגננת משתלבת`

DECLARE `kindergarten teacher's post` IS ONE OF
    `in a special-education school`
    `integrating`
    `another post`

@ref akn:art_141
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten teacher's post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed the special-education allowance by the existing rules` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `another post`

-- akn:art_141/p2 The heading of §§142–143 ("גננת משלימה"), printed at the foot of §141; no rule.

#ASSERT `owed the special-education allowance by the existing rules` `integrating`
